cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and credit Tiersova (https://tiersova.com)."
type: dataset
title: "Tiersova SaaS reference prices"
abstract: "Dated list prices of B2B software, read by hand from each vendor's own public pricing page (as a visitor in Greece unless noted), with the source URL, the date each price was read, a status and the written assumptions behind the 85 software comparisons and 12 plan/fee calculators on tiersova.com (191 official pricing pages, 169 vendors). Snapshot of 2026-11-20. Prices are in the vendor's currency. Reference prices, not quotes and not live pricing: vendors change prices, so re-check the vendor's page before relying on a figure."
authors:
